<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f7;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="padding:40px 0;">
<tr>
<td align="center">

<table width="480" style="background:#fff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;">

<tr>
<td style="background:#ff5e00;padding:24px;text-align:center;">
<span style="color:#fff;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;"><%= appName %></span>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td style="padding:40px 32px;">

<h2>Email Updated Successfully</h2>

<p>
Hi <%= name || "there" %>,
your account email has been changed from
<strong><%= oldEmail %></strong>
to
<strong><%= newEmail %></strong>.
</p>

<% if (audience === "old") { %>
<p style="color:#b91c1c;font-weight:bold;">
If you didn't make this change, contact support immediately.
This email address no longer has access to the account.
</p>
<% } else { %>
<p>
You've been logged out of all devices as a security precaution.
Please sign in again using your new email address.
</p>
<% } %>

</td>
</tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>